", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"fmt task (aliases scheduled_task, task_xml), fields exec_command, exec_arguments, registration_author, registration_date, uri, principal_user_id, r\n-  {\"id\": \"ole-vba\", \"concept\": \"VBA macro project (module names, auto-exec, stomping)\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"fmt vba (and ole alias fields), fields module_names, project_name, has_macros, autoexec_keywords, vba_stream_names, code_page. Reuse lib/meta/cfb.py cfb_streams; d\n-  {\"id\": \"ooxml-siblings\", \"concept\": \"OOXML custom props / remote template / embeddings / internal rel targets\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"fmt ooxml, fields custom_properties (JSON name->value), attached_template_target, internal_relationship_targets, relationship_types, embe\n-  {\"id\": \"synthesis-siblings\", \"concept\": \"Cross-file md5/sha1/size ordering, duplicates, timeline\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"note\", \"detail\": \"lib.meta.synthesis.digest_order(question, get_bytes, algo) now exists (D15 sha256 order, re-asked D16 as metadata-day-16-synthesis-sha256-order with today\n+  {\"id\": \"email-fmt-alias\", \"concept\": \"GM fmt `email` -> prebuilt `eml` fields\", \"priority\": 2, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"New module lib/meta/prebuilt/email.py re-registering EVERY ('eml', f) field of lib/meta/prebuilt/eml.py under fmt 'email' (also 'mail', 'mime') with the same extractor. \n+  {\"id\": \"email-threading\", \"concept\": \"In-Reply-To / References / thread root / reply-forward flags\", \"priority\": 2, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"fmt email (+eml alias), fields in_reply_to, references (compact JSON list, stored order, each id with <>), references_count, thread_root_message_id \n+  {\"id\": \"email-mime-attachments\", \"concept\": \"MIME tree, attachment names/sizes/hashes/types\", \"priority\": 2, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"fmt email, fields mime_part_count,